{"schemaVersion":1,"id":"reference:5a134ca522919ec1","name":"Hssiss","source":{"id":"source:reference-5a134ca522919ec1","title":"Hssiss","revision":27417,"timestamp":"2026-08-04T18:42:01Z","sha256":"d4c56420809c2761ee94432fea7309ad41722d57158aa93b778292aac2c4dafd","url":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?oldid=27417","history":"https://swse.miraheze.org/w/index.php?title=Hssiss&action=history"},"article":{"sourceId":"source:reference-5a134ca522919ec1","blocks":[{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"i","children":["Reference Book: ",{"tag":"a","children":["Jedi Academy Training Manual"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Jedi_Academy_Training_Manual"}]},"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Hssiss are savage, crocodilian predators transformed into abominations by the Dark Side energies of a slain darksider. The transformation is never instantaneous but comes as a result of lingering dark energies tainting the creatures' habitat. ",{"tag":"a","children":["Hutt Crime Lords"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hutt_Crime_Lords"}," sell captured Hssiss to collectors and the occasional Dark Side devotee. Many have escaped capture or been released back into the wilderness, spreading their numbers throughout the galaxy. ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Jedi"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Jedi","referenceId":"reference:d320edb17de6c558"}," refer to Hssiss as \"Dark Side Dragons.\"\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":["Hssiss bear few of the markings common to most abominations affected by ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"},". They are fierce, predatory beasts, with thick scaly green hides and long tails used for balance. Low slung and muscular, they excel at lurking just beneath the water's edge, their eyes rimmed with prominent horns and watching for the next meal. A Hssiss uses its powerful bite to hold struggling prey in place while it rips it apart with razor sharp claws.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Hssiss Encounters"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Hssiss inhabit swamps, marshes, and wetlands and are usually found at the top of the local food chain. Hssiss are drawn to ",{"tag":"a","children":["The Dark Side"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/The_Dark_Side"}," at locations that spawned them and can cluster in impressive numbers. Crime lords and darksiders also buy or round up Hssiss for use as guard beasts, fodder for gladiatorial arenas, or pets.\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h2","children":["Hssiss Statistics (CL 4)"]},"\n",{"tag":"h4","children":["Normal"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":["Large Aquatic ",{"tag":"a","children":["Beast"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Beast","referenceId":"reference:628bf77a740094a9"}," 5 \n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"b","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Initiative"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Initiative","referenceId":"reference:3e687de48a6ad4e5"},":"]}," +4; ",{"tag":"b","children":["Senses:"]}," ",{"tag":"a","children":["Low-Light Vision"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Low-Light_Vision"},", ",{"tag":"a","children":["Perception"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Perception","referenceId":"reference:bd18e320a6bb9f53"}," +3\n"]},"\n",{"tag":"h3","children":["Defenses"]},"\n",{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Reflex Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Reflex_Defense"},": 20 (",{"tag":"a","children":["Flat-Footed"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Flat-Footed"},": 18), ",{"tag":"a","children":["Fortitude Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Fortitude_Defense"},": 19, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Will Defense"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Will_Defense"},": 15\n"]},{"tag":"p","children":[{"tag":"a","children":["Hit Points"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Hit_Points","referenceId":"reference:58e8ee2c9538d027"},": 47, ",{"tag":"a","children":["Damage Threshold"],"href":"https://swse.miraheze.org/wiki/Damage_Threshold"},": 24\n"]},"\n",{"tag":